# covers: 5 E1.3, 5 E1.7, 5 E1.8, 5 E2.1, 5 E3.6, 5 E3.11, 5 E3.15, 5 E4.3, 5 E4.4, 5 E4.6, 5 E4.9, 5 E5.5, 5 E5.6, 5 E5.7, 5 E6.6
# fixture: phase5-manor
# Authored by story 1.8 (expectations) for 3.15 (server assertion sections), 5.7 (UI subscope) and 6.6 (live run).
# Execution evidence is the live gate run (run-sim-ci.py + the schema-2 economy export, story 6.2), never this file alone.
# Expected values: the oracle sidecar <this file>.expect.json (phase5-expectations.py over economy_oracle.py); pack inputs:
# fixtures/phase5-packs.json. RNG-dependent outcomes are asserted on received state; exact draws go through econ-gate labels.
# Waits: delivery 10 ticks*100 ms*3 = 3 s; RPC/login policy 5 s*3 = 15 s; combat fixture allowance 30 s; protection 15 s+5.
# Role blocks (`# role: <name>`) select the pack role whose commands follow; a file without a block is role a.
# econ-gate: sow
# econ-gate: harvest
# econ-gate: crop_reward
# econ-gate: crop_fee
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor item_baseline 3
nf.WaitFor manor_manager_known 15
nf.MarkItemState
nf.ManorBuySeed manor_manager 1 5016 3
nf.WaitFor economy_result == manor_buy_seed 3
nf.Expect adena_delta == -15
nf.Expect inventory_has 5016 == 3
nf.Target template:npc_20003
nf.WaitFor target == "Npc 20003" 3
nf.UseItem 5016 target
nf.WaitFor corpse_seeded_or_sow_failed template:npc_20003 3
nf.Attack
nf.WaitFor entity_dead target 30
nf.UseItem 5125 target
nf.WaitFor harvest_done template:npc_20003 3
nf.Expect manor_drops_unchanged
nf.ManorSellCrop manor_manager template:5073 5073 1 all
nf.WaitFor economy_result == manor_sell_crop 3
nf.Expect manor_fee_equals_p_div_20
# Total budget: the largest role's sum of declared waits + 30 s exit grace.
nf.Within 123
